Usage: whoami [OPTION]

Print effective userid.

Print the user name associated with the current effective user ID.
Same as id -un.

Note: This implementation only supports basic username printing.
Advanced features are not implemented.

OPTIONS:
                 print effective userid
      --help     display this help and exit
  -V, --version  output version information and exit

EXIT STATUS:
  0  if OK,
  1  if minor problems,
  2  if serious trouble.

WinuxCmd is a Windows implementation of GNU CoreUtils for Linux-Windows developers and AI coding assistants.
